{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1332959-\u200bwhy-doesn-t-mega-stamina-give-extra-health-levels","id":1332959,"title":"\u200bWhy doesn't Mega-Stamina give extra health levels?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-08-28T05:37:25-07:00","id":1332959,"title":"\u200bWhy doesn't Mega-Stamina give extra health levels?","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> With three dots of Stamina, a character gains an additional Injured level and at five dots of Stamina she gains an additional Bruised level. </div> </div> </div>In first edition Aberrant Mega-Stamina gave extra health levels, in this edition regular stamina now gives extra health levels, why doesn't Mega-Stamina now give extra health levels?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/299-ninedaysdead","name":"NineDaysDead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T06:18:19-07:00","id":1332962,"title":"","content":"I believe that bit wasn't quite included in the manuscript but I -thought- I remembered someone saying it was meant to work that way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25582-rexford","name":"Rexford","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T08:15:25-07:00","id":1332975,"title":"","content":"Plenty of things like this are present in the Mega-Edges. You buy Mega-Stamina, and then use it as a pre-requisite for Dense Flesh, which gives you more health.<br /> <br /> Having both would be kinda ridiculous in the &quot;combat is going to take forever&quot; sort of way. As well, how Scale interacts with dealing damage by default already means that having a defensive Scale like Mega-Stamina to counter damage Scale is already a huge reduction in the attacker's damage potential.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T08:32:23-07:00","id":1332976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1332959-\u200bwhy-doesn-t-mega-stamina-give-extra-health-levels?p=1332975#post1332975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Plenty of things like this are present in the Mega-Edges. You buy Mega-Stamina, and then use it as a pre-requisite for Dense Flesh, which gives you more health. Having both would be kinda ridiculous in the &quot;combat is going to take forever&quot; sort of way.</div> </div> </div> </div> I'd probably just fold Dense Flesh into Mega-Stamina. And maybe Durability to prevent the armoured egg-shell problem.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1332959-\u200bwhy-doesn-t-mega-stamina-give-extra-health-levels?p=1332975#post1332975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As well, how Scale interacts with dealing damage by default already means that having a defensive Scale like Mega-Stamina to counter damage Scale is already a huge reduction in the attacker's damage potential.</div> </div> </div> </div> I thought mega stamina didn't help against damage?<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1331337-mega-might-stamina-durability-and-combat\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1331337-mega-might-stamina-durability-and-combat\"> Mega-Might/Stamina, Durability, and Combat - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1331337-mega-might-stamina-durability-and-combat\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1331337-mega-might-stamina-durability-and-combat </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> So I've been running a session with my TT group for a few weeks now and things have gone fairly well. We thought we were doing everything right...till we came to </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1331337-mega-might-stamina-durability-and-combat?p=1331367#post1331367\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mega Stamina don\u2019t apply to resisting damage, only poison, disease and what was listed. The reference in MMight saying it\u2019s resisted by the stamina is a mistake, so the Paragon punching the brick would apply full scale (and would be overwhelming).<br /> <br /> The mega edge Durability apply both the armor and the scale to the durability.<br /> <br /> The rest is correct as far as I got it.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/299-ninedaysdead","name":"NineDaysDead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T09:12:53-07:00","id":1332984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>NineDaysDead</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1332959-\u200bwhy-doesn-t-mega-stamina-give-extra-health-levels?p=1332976#post1332976\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I'd probably just fold Dense Flesh into Mega-Stamina. And maybe Durability to prevent the armoured egg-shell problem.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is there a particular reason you feel this is necessary? Storypath as a base system isn't exactly super-lethal in the first place. This seems like it's just going to turn combat into a slog instead of anything else.<br /> <br /> Also I think you have the armored egg-shell problem backwards here. Dense Flesh increases how many injuries you can take (aka you aren't an egg-shell with it), while Durability provides armor.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I thought mega stamina didn't help against damage? </div> </div> </div>We might need to wait and see on the final version. Mega-Stamina doesn't help against direct damage via Mega-Might, but it does work against indirect damage (which I feel would protect you against some of the Mega-Might based Mega-Edge attacks).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T09:47:50-07:00","id":1332992,"title":"","content":"Its slightly backwards but this is from the Mega-Might blurb inside the manuscript.<br /> <br /> The nova receives the benefit of Dramatic Scale when inflicting damage through sheer<br /> Might: 2 Enhancement per difference between the nova\u2019s Mega-Might Scale and the target\u2019s<br /> defensive Scale, such as Mega-Stamina or Durability. So a Mega-Might 4 (Scale 5) nova striking<br /> a Scale 1 target gains 8 Enhancement for inflicting damage.<br /> <br /> The up-take is I think Mega-Stamina wasn't quite &quot;finished&quot; yet as it might have effects that weren't listed (or perhaps this passage is incorrect).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25582-rexford","name":"Rexford","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T10:48:15-07:00","id":1332997,"title":"","content":"Indeed, Danielle was the one pointing it out in the forum. In fact the 1e Mega Attributes were much more powerful than TC and that\u2019s a good thing as I see.<br /> <br /> I mean, you can be resistant to diseases and poison, but not a tough guy, and that\u2019s what the new Mega Stamina means. To be resistant to damage you can be extra resistant (Durability) or be able to fight even after be beaten up hard (Dense Flesh). Same for Mega Dexterity not applying to Defense for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 08-28-2019, 02:56 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T11:26:09-07:00","id":1333001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rexford</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1332959-\u200bwhy-doesn-t-mega-stamina-give-extra-health-levels?p=1332992#post1332992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Its slightly backwards but this is from the Mega-Might blurb inside the manuscript.<br /> <br /> The nova receives the benefit of Dramatic Scale when inflicting damage through sheer<br /> Might: 2 Enhancement per difference between the nova\u2019s Mega-Might Scale and the target\u2019s<br /> defensive Scale, such as Mega-Stamina or Durability. So a Mega-Might 4 (Scale 5) nova striking<br /> a Scale 1 target gains 8 Enhancement for inflicting damage.<br /> <br /> The up-take is I think Mega-Stamina wasn't quite &quot;finished&quot; yet as it might have effects that weren't listed (or perhaps this passage is incorrect).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Danielle confirmed the opposite, that the Mega-Might text was out of date.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/15335-trinity-continuum-ask-the-devs?p=1326825#post1326825\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/15335-trinity-continuum-ask-the-devs?p=1326825#post1326825\"> Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/15335-trinity-continuum-ask-the-devs?p=1326825#post1326825\"> http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/15335-trinity-continuum-ask-the-devs?p=1326825#post1326825 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-28T11:55:55-07:00","id":1333008,"title":"","content":"I corrected my previous post... ignore this one...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-29T17:01:52-07:00","id":1333187,"title":"","content":"Based on my initial read of the text, I felt that most Mega Attributes didn't much at all for the cost you pay for them. How often does one inflict disease and poison on players in a 'modern' game like Aberrant?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1580-andrewm9","name":"andrewm9","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-29T19:52:32-07:00","id":1333208,"title":"","content":"It also accelerate the healing and give enhancements against environmental and indirect damage. That\u2019s one thing that is useful on general situations a Nova can face.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-08-29T23:33:23-07:00","id":1333226,"title":"","content":"Toxins and poisons are really common as weapons supervillians use in inspiration material for Aberrant. I don't think it should be considered unexpected to run up against someone like Poison Ivy as a foe.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-02T11:54:00-07:00","id":1333715,"title":"","content":"Aberrant really isn't a game of supervillains and superheroes though it is a game of superpowers. While I wouldn't consider, poisons and diseases unexpected, hitting PC's with them is hardly common. I guess I as a player expect a little more bang for my buck when I pay 12 XP for something like Mega Stamina 1. 12 XP in terms of this game is significant. Though maybe I am spoiled by playing (and running) 1st edition as I did for so long.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1580-andrewm9","name":"andrewm9","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-02T14:50:58-07:00","id":1333752,"title":"","content":"Diseases and poisons are really rare, but environmental damage and indirect damage no, and Mega Sta grants enhancements on that. So you have 1 enhancement against the aura of fire damage, against radiation, against attic cold and vacuum, etc. Those are more common on Aberrant, for example as a Elite you may need to face an enemy that set fire on the jungle, or the site of a nuclear bomb explosion, or fight enemies on the upper atmosphere (cold and little air).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}